{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2022-01-18 06:30:00', 'title': 'BNY MELLON DECLARES DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, JAN. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON CORPORATION (NYSE: BK) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS AUTHORIZED DIVIDENDS ON ITS COMMON AND PREFERRED STOCK AS FOLLOWS: COMMON – A QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND OF $0.34 PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON FEBRUARY 11, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JANUARY 31, 2022. PREFERRED – THE FOLLOWING DIVIDENDS FOR THE NONCUMULATIVE PERPETUAL PREFERRED STOCK, LIQUIDATION PREFERENCE $100,000 PER SHARE, FOR THE DIVIDEND PERIOD ENDING IN MARCH 2022, IN EACH CASE PAYABLE ON MARCH\xa021, 2022 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MARCH\xa05, 2022: $1,011.11 PER SHARE ON THE SERIES A PREFERRED STOCK (EQUIVALENT TO $10.111111 PER NORMAL PREFERRED CAPITAL SECURITY OF MELLON CAPITAL IV, EACH REPRESENTING A 1/100TH INTEREST IN A SHARE OF THE SERIES A PREFERRED STOCK); $2,312.50 PER SHARE ON THE SERIES F PREFERRED STOCK (EQUIVALENT TO $23.125000 PER DEPOSITARY SHARE, EACH REPRESENTING A 1/100TH INTEREST IN A SHARE OF THE SERIES F PREFERRED STOCK); $2,350.00 PER SHARE ON THE SERIES G PREFERRED STOCK (EQUIVALENT TO $23.500000 PER DEPOSITARY SHARE, EACH REPRESENTING A 1/100TH INTEREST IN A SHARE OF THE SERIES G PREFERRED STOCK); $925.00 PER SHARE ON THE SERIES H PREFERRED STOCK (EQUIVALENT TO $9.250000 PER DEPOSITARY SHARE, EACH REPRESENTING A 1/100TH INTEREST IN A SHARE OF THE SERIES H PREFERRED STOCK); AND $1,270.83 PER SHARE ON THE SERIES I PREFERRED STOCK (EQUIVALENT TO $12.708333 PER DEPOSITARY SHARE, EACH REPRESENTING A 1/100TH INTEREST IN A SHARE OF THE SERIES I PREFERRED STOCK).'}